00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,000
An NTSB investigation takes twelve to twenty-four months.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,500
Class 1 — major, transport-category accidents — down to Class 4 with a six-month final report.

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:07,570
Alaska Airlines Flight 1282 — January 2024 to June 2025. Seventeen months.

4
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:07,570
DCA mid-air collision — January 2025 to March 2025. Two months to urgent recommendations.

